        "Content": "Imposing detached family residence on c.2/3 acre site\r\nElevated site overlooks magnificent grass lawn\r\nGrounds enclosed by granite stone walls with wrought iron railings\r\nAccess via electric gates and granite pillars\r\nSpacious light filled rooms\r\nFeature dormer ceilings\r\nSelf contained studio with livingroom/kitchenette, bedroom and en suite\r\nAdditional block built garden room/home office with power, light and heat\r\nAdditional block built workshop/garage and wood store\r\nGarage built to take additional second storey with Breton slab concrete roof\r\nExterior lighting, outside tap, power points & CCTV cameras\r\nFeature cornice and decorative coving\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nBeautifully maintained grounds\r\nAmple off street parking provided\r\nFully alarmed\r\nOwner occupied\r\nBroadband available\r\nN11/M50 commuter access within easy reach"
